<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Walt Disney/News Corp venture - EU source.</title>
<headline>EU clears Walt Disney/News Corp venture - EU source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared the proposed joint venture between ESPN Inc, a subsidiary of Walt Disney Co, and Star Television Ltd, which belongs to News International Plc, a European Union source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The joint venture, which is to be called NEWCO, would pool all the assets and licences of ESPN's and Star Television's Asian non-standard sports television distribution businesses.</p>
<p>The operation was submitted to the Commission for clearance on October 9 under the EU's merger rules.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
